{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happens when the mistakes you made when you were younger come back to haunt you?<br>Do you try and make amends or embrace them as part of yourself?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690810/extras/title_steam_desc.png?t=1746012285\" /><br><br>Our heroine moves in a new apartment with some quirky roommates and a very talkative cat.<br>As things are starting to look up for her, her past comes knocking, in the form of a very angry Japanese heiress and corporate conspiracy that will spark a war between their companies.<br><br>Will she try unravel said conspiracy or just headbutt away her problems? Will she retake control of her life or just go with the flow? And why is everyone so goddamn horny???<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690810/extras/girls_steam_button.png?t=1746012285\" /><br><br>Actual Roommates is a <i>very</i> horny, <i>very</i> lesbian comedy VN about a goth girl with some baggage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find her the perfect girl (or build her a sapphic harem), make her a perfect bottom or an aggressive top and guide her through a very important(?), very serious(???) plot with its heartfelt moments and ridiculous fight scenes.<br><br>Also there's a cat! And he's got his own episode!<br><br>Features:<br>- 12 Endings;<br>- 40+ Sex scenes;<br>- 2 Diverging storylines;<br>- 8-10 hours of gameplay;<br>- Built-in optional walkthrough;<br>- A Special Cat Episode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690810?t=1746012285","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690810/f20f17e9a038be41f727a234a89dfdfde31ab204/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746012285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690810/5af8b6c00c15489a9b3bc07b1f6da5e4eba9cb2a/capsule_23